     _n_e_t_._p_f_s_y_n_c_._c_a_r_p___d_e_m_o_t_i_o_n___f_a_c_t_o_r
                 Value added to _n_e_t_._i_n_e_t_._c_a_r_p_._d_e_m_o_t_i_o_n while ppffssyynncc tries to
