HHIISSTTOORRYY
     The ppffssyynncc device first appeared in OpenBSD 3.3.  It was first imported
     to FreeBSD 5.3.

     The ppffssyynncc protocol and kernel implementation were significantly modified
     in FreeBSD 9.0.  The newer protocol is not compatible with older one and
     will not interoperate with it.

